From d4921a8bc3d947d0cb3a7cb3f0b58ed52b49e9eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Filippo Luca Ferretti <filippoluca.ferretti@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 17:38:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add missing #include <string> in custom_call_status_internal.h

With newer libabseil (20260107+), absl/strings/string_view.h no longer
transitively includes <string>, only bringing in the forward declaration
via <iosfwd>. This causes a compilation failure when <optional> tries
to instantiate optional<std::string> with only an incomplete type.

--- a/third_party/xla/xla/service/custom_call_status_internal.h
+++ b/third_party/xla/xla/service/custom_call_status_internal.h
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@ limitations under the License.

 #include <optional>
+#include <string>

 #include "absl/strings/string_view.h"
